{"task_id": "Mbpp/88", "solution": "class FreqCounter:\n    \"\"\"Helper class to encapsulate the frequency counting logic.\"\"\"\n    def freq_count(self, input_list: list) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"Counts the frequency of elements in a list and returns a dictionary.\"\"\"\n        frequencies = {}\n        for element in input_list:\n            frequencies[element] = frequencies.get(element, 0) + 1\n        return frequencies\ndef freq_count(input_list: list) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the frequency of all elements in a list.\n\n    Delegates the counting to a helper FreqCounter class.\n    \"\"\"\n    counter = FreqCounter()\n    return counter.freq_count(input_list)"}
