{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "from typing import List\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\ndef zero_count(list_of_ints: List[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Compute and return ratio of zeros to non-zero elements.\n\n    Raises ValueError if non_zero_count is zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_zero_count = 0\n    current_non_zero_count = 0\n\n    for num in list_of_ints:\n        if num == 0:\n            current_zero_count += 1\n        else:\n            current_non_zero_count += 1\n\n    if current_non_zero_count == 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"non_zero_count is zero; cannot compute ratio\")\n\n    calculated_ratio = float(current_zero_count) / float(current_non_zero_count)\n\n    # Instantiate CountResult as an internal representation, as per design\n    _ = CountResult(\n        zero_count=current_zero_count,\n        non_zero_count=current_non_zero_count,\n        ratio=calculated_ratio\n    )\n\n    return calculated_ratio"}
