{"task_id": "Mbpp/459", "solution": "from dataclasses import dataclass\ndef remove_uppercase(input: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Pure function: removes ASCII uppercase letters A-Z and returns resulting string.\"\"\"\n    if not input:\n        return \"\"\n\n    result_chars = []\n    for char_val in input:\n        char_obj = Character(value=char_val)\n        if not char_obj.is_uppercase():\n            result_chars.append(char_val)\n\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
